# Interface Vision (Retro Console Theme)

Sidequest Mail should feel like an 8-bit menu — but work like Proton Mail.
The pixel art is the skin, not the mechanics.
Everything below is aesthetic and optional; the core email flow (read, reply, file, delete) must always be instant.

---

## Layout Grid

| Screen       | Console Concept        | Behavior                                                                 |
|:-------------|:------------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Inbox**    | The Level Select       | Emails are blocks on a grid. Unread blocks have a "NEW!" star.           |
|              |                         | Opening one "selects" it — the star disappears.                          |
| **Folders**  | The Save Files         | Each folder is a save slot. Navigating there shows: *"Load Game."*       |
| **Sent**     | The High Score         | You sent it. "New High Score" energy.                                    |
| **Trash**    | The Game Over          | Where data gets deleted. Dragging an email there triggers a "Game Over" screen. |
|              |                         | Restoring it is "Continue?"                                              |
| **Drafts**   | The Pause Screen       | Still being played. "Press Start to Continue."                           |

---

## Navigation Grid

| Key          | Action                 | Flavor Text                              |
|:-------------|:-----------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| **Arrow Keys** | Move focus between emails | 8-bit chime sound                  |
| **Spacebar**   | Open selected email    | *"Start!"*                               |
| **Enter**      | Reply while reading    | *"Press A to Jump."*                     |
| **Drag & Drop** | Move between folders   | Block swap animation                   |

---

## Visual Design Grid

| Element        | Concept            | Description                                                                 |
|:---------------|:-------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Sidebar**    | The D-Pad          | Looks like a Game Boy D-pad. Fonts are chunky pixel fonts.                   |
| **Email Cards** | Game Blocks        | Each email is a block with sender's name and subject. Unread blocks glow.    |
| **Compose**    | The Menu           | A retro menu screen. Subject line = Option 1.                                |
| **Stickers**   | Power-Ups          | Inserting a sticker adds a power-up icon (Mushroom, Star, etc.).             |

---

## Micro-interactions Grid

| Action         | Sound / Effect     | Trigger Context                          |
|:---------------|:-------------------|:-----------------------------------------|
| Reading        | 8-bit pop          | Like a menu selection                    |
| Replying       | 8-bit ding         | Like a coin collection                   |
| Deleting       | 8-bit crash        | Like a character falling                 |
| Searching      | 8-bit scan         | Like a radar screen                      |
| Composing      | 8-bit typing       | Like a keyboard input                    |
| Loading        | Progress bar       | Fills like a health bar                  |

> All sounds default to **off**, toggle
